OL,3,GNEWSAActivists 'armed with kebab
OL,4,Askewers' in Elbit raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FPalestine Action activists armed with
OL,7,Fkebab skewers, whips and hammers
OL,8,Fattacked security guards during a raid
OL,9,Fat a factory, a court has heard.
OL,11,FQesser Zuhrah, 21, Zahra Farooque, 26,
OL,12,FKamran Ahmed, 29, Heba Muraisi, 31, and
OL,13,FLiam Mullany, 34, are on trial for
OL,14,Ftheir role in the break-in at the Elbit
OL,15,FSystems UK Ltd factory on 6 August
OL,16,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
