OL,3,GNEWSAActivists 'armed with kebab
OL,4,Askewers' in Elbit raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe five, who deny charges of criminal
OL,7,Fdamage and violent disorder, are
OL,8,Faccused of overwhelming guards so that
OL,9,Fothers activists could break in and
OL,10,Fdamage items inside the factory at
OL,11,FFilton, on the outskirts of Bristol.
OL,13,FAt their trial at Woolwich Crown Court,
OL,14,Fjurors heard a guard suffered a 4cm
OL,15,Fgash to his head in the attack.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
